('57368','学歴や経験をとわず、やる気のある応募者を雇う！',23,'We are hiring motivated applicants <strong>with or without</strong> experience or academic background! (<strong>regardless of</strong>)','学歴や経験を問わず、やる気のある応募者を雇う！.ogg',NULL,'N2','bunpro JLPT2 validated','N1','N1','-','N1','学歴:N1,経験:N4,頭:N5,やる気:CO,ある:N5,応募:N1,者:N5,雇う:N3','N1','学:N5,歴:N2,経:N3,験:N4,気:N5,応:N1,募:N2,者:N4,雇:N2','-','-'),
