('3982','"４月の地震のあと、阿蘇山の近くに観光に来る人が少なくなりました。"',34,'After the earthquake in April, near Mt. Asobe has had fewer people come to sight-see.<br/>April + の + earthquake + の + after + Mt. Asobe + の + near + に + sightseeing + に + come + people + が + fewer + became','NDL_4116_Male.ogg',NULL,NULL,'nihongoshark','N4','N4','地震:N5@bunpro,観光:N4@bunpro','N3','４月:N5,地震:N4,あれ:N5,阿蘇山:PN,近く:N5,観光:N3,来る:N5,人:N5,少ない:N5,なる:N5','N1','月:N5,地:N4,震:N2,阿:N1,山:N5,近:N4,観:N3,光:N3,来:N5,人:N5,少:N4','-','-'),
