('13974','そこの角で車同士が衝突したのよ。',16,'The cars collided into each other at the corner there.','1347_iknow_words_js00680a.ogg','assets0.iknow.jp/assets/legacy/JLL/audio/Int/JS00680A.mp3',NULL,'iknow_words','N3','N3','-','N3','そこ:N5,角:N5,車:N5,同士:N3,衝突:N3','N1','角:N2,車:N5,同:N4,士:N1,衝:N1,突:N3','-','-'),
