('13981','そこは、一万羽以上のペンギンが暮らすペンギン王国でした。',28,'That was the Penguin Kingdom, where over ten thousand penguins live.','506_tofugu_17.ogg','tofugu/japanese-counter-wa/17.mp3',NULL,'tofugu','N3','N3','-','N3','そこ:N5,万羽:PN,ペンギン:CO,暮らす:N3,王国:N3','N2','一:N5,万:N5,羽:N2,以:N4,上:N5,暮:N3,王:N3,国:N5','-','-'),
